# .hygiene-allow: <path-glob>: <group>[,<group>]; `*` stays inside one path segment.
# Every row sits under its reason (packet agentik-r1-commons, ruling 6).

# agentik-commons exists to name its sibling agentik tools and plugins: the README,
# the records and packets, the backlog, the sibling paragraph, the marketplace,
# its check and that check's test
README.md: sibling
NICE_TO_HAVE.md: sibling
design/*.md: sibling
docs/sibling.md: sibling
.claude-plugin/marketplace.json: sibling
scripts/marketplace-check: sibling
tests/test_marketplace.py: sibling

# a packet names its read-only sources by path
design/packets/*.md: sibling,home

# hygiene's own patterns name the old tools; its test assembles them at runtime
scripts/hygiene: renamed
tests/test_hygiene.py: renamed

# the guide's alias paragraph lists the old names; the guide names the five tools
GUIDE.md: renamed,sibling

# the copyright line names its holder
LICENSE: person
